SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Page updated: Maine Judicial Branch Jury Stat
 us Notices
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + **Please note that August dates have changed: Housekeeping scheduled 
 Wed Aug 5th at 9am for Jurors #1-199 has been CANCELLED\n  + Juror houseke
 eping for Jurors #200-300 will be held on August 5th at 1:00 p.m. Jury Sel
 ection is Thurs Aug 6th at 9am and Fri Aug 7th at 9am. Plan to appear unle
