 or trial as directed by the Justice.\n  + ***Jurors selected in the matter
  of\n  + State v Strout\n  + are to report for trial at 10:30AM on Wednesd
 ay\, August 5th.\n  + All\n  + August 2026 Jurors\n  + are to report at 8:
 30AM on Monday\, August 10\n  + th\n  + for jury selection.\n  + Thank you
  and have a wonderful evening!\n  + August 4\, 2026\n  + Juror numbers 1-1
 24 are expected to report to the Franklin County Superior Court House on A
 ugust 5th at 10am and juror numbers 125-250 are expected to report at 1:00
 pm. All traverse jurors are to report on August 7th at 8:30 am.\n  + All t
 raverse jurors are to report to the Hancock County Superior Court on Augus
 t 5\, 2026 by 9:00 AM for jury selection.\n  + August 4\, 2026\nRemoved:\n
   - **Please note that August dates have changed: Housekeeping will be hel
 d on Wed Aug 5th at 9am for Jurors #1-199 and 1pm for Jurors #200-300\, Ju
